1
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:04,940
Welcome to JEI Learning Centers.

2
00:00:05,390 --> 00:00:10,270
JEI provides personalized education
through the JEI Self-Learning Method.

3
00:00:10,720 --> 00:00:13,590
Our goal is to help students
learn independently,

4
00:00:13,649 --> 00:00:16,460
build confidence, and
develop good study habits.

5
00:00:18,110 --> 00:00:22,100
Today, we will introduce JEI
Learning Centers in North America.

6
00:00:22,550 --> 00:00:25,446
First, we will provide a
company overview, including

7
00:00:25,501 --> 00:00:27,840
our history, business model, and students.

8
00:00:28,290 --> 00:00:30,760
Next, we will introduce
our learning programs

9
00:00:30,815 --> 00:00:33,010
and compare them with major competitors.

10
00:00:33,460 --> 00:00:37,870
Finally, we will explain our franchise
business structure and online platforms.

11
00:00:39,520 --> 00:00:43,100
JEI was founded by Sung
Hoon Park in South Korea.

12
00:00:43,550 --> 00:00:46,360
He developed the JEI
Self-Learning Method to help

13
00:00:46,417 --> 00:00:49,170
students learn at their
own pace in small steps.

14
00:00:49,620 --> 00:00:54,720
In 1992, JEI Learning Centers was
established in the United States.

15
00:00:55,170 --> 00:00:58,967
Since then, JEI has expanded into
several international markets,

16
00:00:59,027 --> 00:01:02,290
including Canada, Australia,
New Zealand and Hong Kong.

17
00:01:03,940 --> 00:01:06,690
JEI operates after-school
learning centers where

18
00:01:06,748 --> 00:01:09,670
students study at their
individual learning levels.

19
00:01:10,120 --> 00:01:14,150
Students typically visit a center
once a week for a 60-minute session.

20
00:01:14,600 --> 00:01:17,374
Our classes have a
teacher-to-student ratio of one to

21
00:01:17,426 --> 00:01:20,410
five, allowing teachers to
provide personalized coaching.

22
00:01:20,860 --> 00:01:23,412
Students also receive
one workbook per subject

23
00:01:23,467 --> 00:01:26,130
each week to support
continued learning at home.

24
00:01:27,780 --> 00:01:31,809
As of June 2026, JEI operates
54 learning centers across

25
00:01:31,881 --> 00:01:36,270
North America, with 44 in the
United States and 10 in Canada.

26
00:01:36,720 --> 00:01:40,710
Our major locations include
California, New Jersey, and New York.

27
00:01:42,360 --> 00:01:45,096
However, the number of
JEI centers has declined

28
00:01:45,155 --> 00:01:47,600
significantly over the past several years.

29
00:01:48,050 --> 00:01:51,833
While major competitors have
recovered and expanded, JEI continues

30
00:01:51,890 --> 00:01:55,100
to face challenges in
strengthening its market position.

31
00:01:55,550 --> 00:02:00,270
This highlights the need for clearer brand
positioning and stronger competitiveness.

32
00:02:01,920 --> 00:02:05,290
Math and English are
JEI's two main subjects.

33
00:02:05,740 --> 00:02:08,997
Math accounts for 53.6
percent of total subject

34
00:02:09,067 --> 00:02:12,740
enrollments, while English
accounts for 41.3 percent.

35
00:02:13,190 --> 00:02:16,760
Together, they represent nearly
95 percent of our business.

36
00:02:17,410 --> 00:02:21,390
More than 60 percent of our students
are in grades two through six.

37
00:02:21,840 --> 00:02:26,710
This shows that elementary Math and English
are the core of JEI's current business.

38
00:02:28,460 --> 00:02:31,600
JEI offers four main learning programs.

39
00:02:32,050 --> 00:02:34,660
JEI Math helps students
develop mathematical

40
00:02:34,720 --> 00:02:37,330
understanding through
step-by-step learning.

41
00:02:37,780 --> 00:02:41,510
Problem Solving Math develops
advanced problem-solving skills.

42
00:02:41,960 --> 00:02:44,986
JEI English builds a strong
foundation in phonics,

43
00:02:45,046 --> 00:02:47,890
grammar, vocabulary, and
reading comprehension.

44
00:02:48,340 --> 00:02:52,490
The JEI Pen also supports
pronunciation and listening.

45
00:02:52,940 --> 00:02:55,628
Finally, Reading and
Writing strengthens reading

46
00:02:55,684 --> 00:02:58,260
comprehension, writing
skills, and creativity.

47
00:02:59,910 --> 00:03:05,130
JEI competes with major learning brands
such as Kumon, Mathnasium, and Eye Level.

48
00:03:05,580 --> 00:03:07,620
Each company has different strengths.

49
00:03:08,070 --> 00:03:11,300
Kumon focuses on repetition
and calculation skills.

50
00:03:11,750 --> 00:03:15,870
Mathnasium emphasizes personalized
math instruction and coaching.

51
00:03:16,320 --> 00:03:20,060
Eye Level combines foundational
math skills with critical thinking.

52
00:03:20,710 --> 00:03:24,027
JEI's strengths include structured
workbooks, individualized

53
00:03:24,083 --> 00:03:26,460
learning, and personalized
teacher support.

54
00:03:26,910 --> 00:03:29,967
However, we also need to
improve our content, digital

55
00:03:30,024 --> 00:03:32,850
learning options, and
consistency across centers.

56
00:03:34,600 --> 00:03:37,360
Now, let's look at our
franchise business structure.

57
00:03:37,810 --> 00:03:40,786
JEI's monthly tuition
generally ranges from

58
00:03:40,855 --> 00:03:43,900
130 to 180 dollars,
depending on the center.

59
00:03:44,350 --> 00:03:47,520
This is lower than Mathnasium's
typical tuition range.

60
00:03:48,170 --> 00:03:50,758
JEI also uses a tiered royalty structure,

61
00:03:50,821 --> 00:03:53,850
with lower fees as subject
enrollments increase.

62
00:03:54,300 --> 00:03:58,260
This structure helps support
franchise operations as centers grow.

63
00:03:59,910 --> 00:04:03,210
JEI entered the U.S. market in 1992.

64
00:04:03,660 --> 00:04:06,397
Today, we compete with
well-established brands,

65
00:04:06,456 --> 00:04:08,960
including Kumon,
Mathnasium, and Eye Level.

66
00:04:09,410 --> 00:04:12,640
Over recent years, Kumon and
Mathnasium have continued

67
00:04:12,700 --> 00:04:15,690
to expand, while JEI's
network has become smaller.

68
00:04:16,140 --> 00:04:18,998
This comparison shows why
JEI needs to strengthen

69
00:04:19,056 --> 00:04:22,030
its competitive position
and support future growth.

70
00:04:23,780 --> 00:04:26,791
Finally, JEI connects with
customers and franchise

71
00:04:26,851 --> 00:04:29,380
